rs incorporated  into the scene among them when they  first break into the house Tex Watson  tells cliff I'm the devil and I'm here  to do the devil's business Watson  reportedly said this upon breaking into  Tate's house that night when preparing  to play Tate actress Margot Robbie  worked closely with several members of  the Tate family an interview on today  Robbie said Sharon's sister Deborah gave  her some of Sharon's jewelry to wear in  the movie the night of the murders Tate  and her friends went to dinner at a  Mexican restaurant called el coyote in  the movie when she walks into the  restaurant he notices a porn movie  premiere happening down the  three this was likely happening at the  eros theater which at the time was an  adult movie theater just around the  corner from el coyote a today the eros  theater is the new Beverly cinema a  movie theater oh my none other than  Quentin Tarantino that's not the only  theater to pop up throughout the movie  Tarantino pays tribute to many of the  great movie theaters of his childhood in  Los Angeles to such theaters include the  Bruin where Tate goes to watch her movie  the wrecking crew at one point cliff  drives by the iconic Cinerama both  theaters still exist today there are  many iconic la locations throughout Rick  meets producer Marvin Shores at Musso  and Frank's grill which has been around  since 1919 the crew filmed on-location  in the restaurant even let them use the  dishes the restaurant would have used in  the 1960s at one point we see Cliff  picking up Rick from the Columbia  Pictures lot Columbia which is now part  of Sony produced once upon a time in  Hollywood all the studio's wall you can  see a giant poster for the Barbra  Streisand classic funny girl which the  studio released in 1968 another famous  location can actually be spotted in  plenty of other TV shows and movies when  cliff Rick and Rick's new wife returned  from Rome they walked past a blue mosaic  tile wall in LAX it's the same wall