ce Tarantino grew up during the  60s he also added a few personal touches  to the film cliff drives a Carmen Gia  just like Tarantino's father did and  some of the props in Rick's house are  from Tarantino's personal collection  specifically the Hopalong Cassidy cups  was there anything we missed  let us know in the comments  [Music]
 

